Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.60,0:00:04.04,Default,NOBARA AND KOTOBUKI,0,0,0,,T-To the festival?!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.93,0:00:04.40,italicstop,FESTIVAL PEOPLE,0,0,0,,Wasshoi! Wasshoi! Wasshoi!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.80,0:00:06.86,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Well... Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.73,0:00:12.51,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,I always go with you guys, so I wanted \Nto let you know ahead of time.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.51,0:00:15.32,Default,KOTOBUKI,0,0,0,,Wow, that's awesome. I'm so jealous!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.61,0:00:18.08,Default,NOBARA,0,0,0,,Sounds nice, going to the summer \Nfestival with a guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.52,0:00:20.79,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Oh, then do you guys want to come with us?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.11,0:00:23.49,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,I'd feel better if you guys were there.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.49,0:00:24.28,Default,KOTOBUKI,0,0,0,,Are you an idiot?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.28,0:00:25.42,Default,NOBARA,0,0,0,,Read the room.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.42,0:00:28.13,Default,KOTOBUKI,0,0,0,,But I see, I see. That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.39,0:00:31.15,Default,NOBARA,0,0,0,,The trial period is almost over,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.15,0:00:34.51,Default,NOBARA,0,0,0,,so you guys would have to \Ndecide pretty soon, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.77,0:00:42.06,Default,SHUN,0,0,0,,Hey, what do you want\Nto do for the summer festival?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.37,0:00:44.81,Default,SENTARO,0,0,0,,Oh, it's that time \Nof the year, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.57,0:00:48.66,Default,SHUN,0,0,0,,The girls from Class D are all saying \Nwe should all go together, and—
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.66,0:00:49.01,Default,SENTARO,0,0,0,,I'll go.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.01,0:00:49.82,Default,SHUN,0,0,0,,That was fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.82,0:00:52.09,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Oh, hey, Teach!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.09,0:00:53.28,Default,SHUN,0,0,0,,Yes, Ichimura-kun?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.64,0:00:57.27,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,I'm going with Yoi-chan,\Nso can I be dismissed?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.99,0:01:00.27,Default,SHUN,0,0,0,,Seriously?! That's the \Nfirst I'm hearing of this!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.27,0:01:01.57,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,It's the first time I'm saying it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.57,0:01:03.14,Default,SENTARO,0,0,0,,Wh-When did you guys decide this?!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.14,0:01:03.80,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.80,0:01:04.33,Default,SENTARO,0,0,0,,Yest—
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.57,0:01:07.05,Default,SENTARO,0,0,0,,Damn you! Damn you to {\i1}hell{\i0}!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.05,0:01:09.04,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Quit wishing ill on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.04,0:01:12.80,Default,SHUN,0,0,0,,Oh, hey, isn't your little \Nexperiment almost over?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.80,0:01:14.30,Default,SHUN,0,0,0,,You still don't have an answer?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.70,0:01:16.86,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Well, there's no need to rush that.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.01,0:01:19.57,Default,SHUN,0,0,0,,Look at you, getting carried away.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.57,0:01:22.30,Default,SENTARO,0,0,0,,Hey, you really okay saying that?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.78,0:01:25.87,Default,SENTARO,0,0,0,,She might just get taken \Nby another man, y'know.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.87,0:01:26.55,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.55,0:01:29.67,Default,SENTARO,0,0,0,,The Prince has been looking \Noddly cute lately.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.67,0:01:30.71,Default,SHUN,0,0,0,,That's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.71,0:01:33.07,Default,SENTARO,0,0,0,,There's other guys who'd \Nbe interested in her, too, yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.34,0:01:36.83,Default,SENTARO,0,0,0,,Besides, if one of you falls \Nin love with someone else,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.83,0:01:38.45,Default,SENTARO,0,0,0,,the contract gets terminated, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.99,0:01:41.91,Default,SENTARO,0,0,0,,Shouldn't you be takin' it \Na little more seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.91,0:01:43.61,Default,SENTARO,0,0,0,,Just kiddin'!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.04,0:01:48.79,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,I wonder...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.14,0:01:53.03,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Whose mouth is that ridiculous \Nclaim coming from?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.29,0:01:53.98,top,SENTARO,0,0,0,,O-Ow, I'm sorry! I'm sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.03,0:01:56.23,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Oh? It's {\i1}you{\i0}, Sentaro-kun!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.03,0:01:54.46,overlaptop,SHUN,0,0,0,,It's the Romero Special!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.75,0:01:57.03,top,SENTARO,0,0,0,,I said I was kiddin'!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.03,0:01:58.63,Default,SHUN,0,0,0,,Sentaro, you got this'?!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.19,0:02:01.37,top,SENTARO,0,0,0,,No, I give up! I give up!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.43,0:02:00.92,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,And, where's my sorry? Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.17,0:02:01.97,overlaptop,SHUN,0,0,0,,And the winner is Ichi!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.35,0:03:37.15,Default,DAD,0,0,0,,Yoi, Oji-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.15,0:03:40.18,Default,DAD,0,0,0,,Business is a bit slow right now, so I'm \Ngoing to head out to get some things.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.55,0:03:42.26,Default,DAD,0,0,0,,You two go ahead and eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.26,0:03:43.31,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Oh, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.31,0:03:44.43,Default,OJI,0,0,0,,Understood.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.64,0:03:48.95,Default,YOI AND OJI,0,0,0,,Thank you for the meal.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.93,0:03:52.50,Default,OJI,0,0,0,,Whoa, that's good!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.06,0:03:56.29,Default,OJI,0,0,0,,No matter how many times I eat \Nthe curry here, it's delicious!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.29,0:03:58.67,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Dad would be happy to hear that.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.50,0:04:03.05,Default,OJI,0,0,0,,You know, I partly took this\Njob for the free meals.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.05,0:04:05.27,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Free meals are a perk, for sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.27,0:04:07.77,Default,OJI,0,0,0,,Hey. Yoi-san, that drink you have...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.77,0:04:09.76,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Oh, it's a lassi.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.76,0:04:11.06,Default,OJI,0,0,0,,A lassi?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.85,0:04:13.11,italics,OJI,0,0,0,,I wonder if it's sweet.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.61,0:04:15.15,Default,OJI,0,0,0,,Do you like sweet things?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.45,0:04:18.11,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Oh, no, not particularly—
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.05,0:04:21.07,flashback,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,You've got a serious sweet tooth!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.58,0:04:25.48,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,I didn't think I did, \Nbut apparently I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.48,0:04:27.83,Default,OJI,0,0,0,,Huh? What do you mean, "apparently"?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.83,0:04:29.21,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.77,0:04:32.38,Default,OJI,0,0,0,,You know, you're an interesting \Nperson, Yoi-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.38,0:04:37.18,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.13,0:04:43.71,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Are yukatas... something guys like?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.94,0:04:45.68,Default,OJI,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.14,0:04:51.71,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Oh, it's just... my friend is planning to\Ngo to the summer festival with a guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.65,0:04:55.98,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,It seems like she's having trouble \Ndeciding whether to wear one that day...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.17,0:05:01.36,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,But... she's concerned \Nabout her boyish look
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.36,0:05:04.36,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,and whether it'd look good on her.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.32,0:05:07.55,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,So she's wondering what to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.33,0:05:15.28,Default,OJI,0,0,0,,Regardless of whether\Nit looks good or not,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.28,0:05:17.46,Default,OJI,0,0,0,,I'd say I definitely would be happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.46,0:05:18.15,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.87,0:05:23.75,Default,OJI,0,0,0,,Knowing she went through all the trouble \Nto dress up just for you
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.75,0:05:25.51,Default,OJI,0,0,0,,would make any guy excited.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.45,0:05:28.63,Default,OJI,0,0,0,,We're surprisingly simple like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.69,0:05:30.98,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,Oh, I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.94,0:05:33.64,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.21,0:05:35.93,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Oh, I'll let her know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.51,0:05:38.56,Default,OJI,0,0,0,,I'm glad I could be of help.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.01,0:05:41.15,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,Is that right.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.82,0:05:46.42,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.02,0:05:50.84,Default,OJI,0,0,0,,Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.33,0:05:56.87,Default,OJI,0,0,0,,Are you planning on going with someone \Nto the summer festival, Yoi-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.45,0:05:58.14,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,What...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.07,0:06:06.55,Default,DAD,0,0,0,,I'm back!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.55,0:06:08.51,Default,OJI,0,0,0,,W-Welcome back!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.75,0:06:10.57,Default,DAD,0,0,0,,Oh, you guys finished eating?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.57,0:06:12.01,Default,OJI,0,0,0,,Yes, it was delicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.31,0:06:16.16,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,That took me by surprise...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.16,0:06:19.44,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,Suddenly locking eyes with him when\Nhe's so close is nerve-wrecking.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.69,0:06:20.93,Default,DAD,0,0,0,,Oh, that's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.93,0:06:23.45,Default,DAD,0,0,0,,I picked up some customers on the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.45,0:06:24.40,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.87,0:06:28.36,Default,DAD,0,0,0,,Ta-da, it's Ichimura-kun and the gang!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.36,0:06:30.75,top,SHUN,0,0,0,,Hey, it's really a curry place.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.00,0:06:30.75,Default,DAD,0,0,0,,Come on in and have lots to eat!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.01,0:06:30.75,overlaptop,SENTARO,0,0,0,,Curry! Curry!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.18,0:06:32.45,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,Senpai?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.13,0:06:34.16,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Why are you...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.43,0:06:39.33,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Sentaro said he really wanted curry.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.91,0:06:41.04,Default,SENTARO,0,0,0,,Sorry, Prince.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.51,0:06:46.84,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,I was opposed to it 'cause I knew \NI'd get in trouble with you, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.91,0:06:49.05,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.05,0:06:52.54,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Huh? Did you always have this \Nhandsome guy working here?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.54,0:06:53.22,Default,OJI,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.22,0:06:56.52,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,H-Hey, please don't bother our part-timer.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.74,0:06:59.19,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Sorry about them.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.19,0:07:00.18,Default,OJI,0,0,0,,Oh, no worries.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.21,0:07:04.13,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Hmm, a new part-timer, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.82,0:07:07.47,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Hmm? What?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.47,0:07:09.01,Default,SHUN,0,0,0,,It's a shame, Ichi.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.01,0:07:10.40,Default,SENTARO,0,0,0,,Such a fleeting love you had there.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.73,0:07:13.03,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Huh?! What're you guys talkin' about?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.81,0:07:25.08,flashback italics,SENTARO,0,0,0,,The Prince has been looking \Noddly cute lately.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.75,0:07:45.73,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Let's make sure I got your order right.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.73,0:07:48.86,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,A chicken, a beef, and a special, correct?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.28,0:07:51.24,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.24,0:07:53.32,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Why are you staring \Nat my face like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.77,0:07:56.31,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Hmm? Oh, my bad, my bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.81,0:07:59.05,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,I was just thinkin' about how \Nbeautiful you are today.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.90,0:08:00.79,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.45,0:08:07.31,Default,SHUN,0,0,0,,H-Hey, Ichi, how do you say something \Nso forward with such ease?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.29,0:08:10.11,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Oh, come on. It's the truth, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.11,0:08:11.89,Default,DAD,0,0,0,,H-Hey, he's making {\i1}me{\i0} blush.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.03,0:08:15.43,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,What is wrong with him?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.52,0:08:19.11,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Three new customers with \None serving each, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.11,0:08:20.14,Default,DAD,0,0,0,,You got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.45,0:08:23.77,Default,OJI,0,0,0,,Oh, Yoi-san, there's \Nsomething on your ear.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.33,0:08:25.69,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Where is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.69,0:08:27.62,Default,OJI,0,0,0,,Oh, a little to the left.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.62,0:08:28.23,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.48,0:08:30.68,Default,OJI,0,0,0,,Uh, and a little down...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.68,0:08:33.90,Default,OJI,0,0,0,,Um... Right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.99,0:08:35.97,Default,OJI,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.87,0:08:39.88,Default,OJI,0,0,0,,Huh? What is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.88,0:08:41.10,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Yogurt?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.82,0:08:42.50,Default,YOI AND OJI,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.83,0:08:44.53,Default,YOI AND OJI,0,0,0,,The lassi!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.29,0:08:47.06,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,That's embarrassing.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.06,0:08:48.55,Default,OJI,0,0,0,,Oh, not at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.55,0:08:49.50,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.89,0:08:53.72,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Oops, sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.72,0:08:55.30,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Seems like my hand slipped.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.77,0:08:57.40,Default,SHUN,0,0,0,,Ichi, you good?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.40,0:08:59.89,Default,DAD,0,0,0,,Oh, no worries. \NWe'll wipe it up right away.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.22,0:09:01.32,Default,DAD,0,0,0,,Yoi, get a rag.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.32,0:09:02.77,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Oh, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.07,0:09:04.25,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.86,0:09:06.65,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Yeah, sorry about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.87,0:09:08.59,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Did it get on your clothes?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.59,0:09:09.40,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Nah.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.40,0:09:11.73,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,It's a good thing it didn't \Nspill as much as I thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.15,0:09:12.86,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.24,0:09:18.91,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,I did it on purpose.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.42,0:09:20.05,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.20,0:09:32.59,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Senpai, can we talk?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.59,0:09:34.38,sign_generic,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fs10\fnComic Sans MS\b1\bord0.25\3c&HC8D0DC&\c&HC8D0DC&\frz35.47\frx346\fry20\move(166,190,166,-35,0,1790)\fax-.3}Nasu Oyaji Curry
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.04,0:09:36.05,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Just what is going on here?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.42,0:09:39.01,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,I could ban you from our store\Nfor disruptive behavior, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.27,0:09:41.73,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,I'm very sorry. I won't do it again.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.73,0:09:43.86,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Look me in the eye\Nwhen you say it, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.20,0:09:45.30,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Jeez...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.30,0:09:48.53,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,That newbie {\i1}sure{\i0} is handsome, isn't he?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.10,0:09:56.82,sign_generic,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fs32\fnComic Sans MS\b1\bord0.25\3c&HD0DFEA&\c&HDCDFE2&\frz349.4\move(295.333,109.999,295.333,238)\frx12\fry6}Nasu {\c&HCAE4EF&}Oyaji {\c&HC5D5E4&}Curry
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.54,0:09:52.25,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Wh-Why did you say that?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.25,0:09:53.78,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Oh, no reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.78,0:09:56.82,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,I just happened to see you\Ntwo talking while I walked in.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.50,0:10:02.05,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,You seemed awfully close, so I was \Ncurious what you were talking about.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.54,0:10:06.29,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,That doesn't have anything \Nto do with you, Senpai.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.89,0:10:07.81,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Is that so?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.24,0:10:13.01,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Actually, you're acting kind \Nof strange today, Senpai.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.01,0:10:15.21,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Not at all like yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.59,0:10:19.67,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,It feels like I'm back to the \Ntime when I couldn't figure him out.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.18,0:10:20.93,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,It's nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.89,0:10:23.14,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,I'm just jealous is all.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.05,0:10:24.65,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.56,0:10:30.67,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,I'm goin' inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.36,0:10:34.82,Default,SENTARO,0,0,0,,Oh, Ichi, you're back.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.53,0:10:41.08,Default,SENTARO,0,0,0,,Huh, where you goin'?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.08,0:10:42.10,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Gotta shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.10,0:10:42.74,Default,SENTARO,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.49,0:10:45.45,Default,SHUN,0,0,0,,Oh, the bathroom.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.55,0:10:50.90,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.94,0:10:54.12,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Pisses me off...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.43,0:11:07.54,flashback,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,I'm just jealous is all.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.78,0:11:14.99,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.54,0:11:29.83,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,What did he mean by that?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.50,0:11:32.94,Default,SENTARO,0,0,0,,Oh, man. I'm stuffed.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.94,0:11:36.47,Default,SHUN,0,0,0,,Well, you ended up ordering \Ntwo servings' worth, Sentaro.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.07,0:11:38.05,Default,SENTARO,0,0,0,,My bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.44,0:11:41.07,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,I was the one who ended \Nup finishing most of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.76,0:11:43.01,Default,SENTARO,0,0,0,,My bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.62,0:11:44.97,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,So, you know—
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.47,0:11:52.23,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,After that, Senpai ate curry and \Nchatted as if nothing had happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.15,0:11:55.99,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,But he still hasn't looked at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.30,0:11:57.61,Default,DAD,0,0,0,,Hey, Yoi.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.88,0:11:58.82,Default,DAD,0,0,0,,Yoi?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.95,0:12:06.31,Default,OJI,0,0,0,,Oh, that was a close one.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.66,0:12:09.60,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,I-I'm so sorry! I'm so careless.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.60,0:12:12.03,Default,OJI,0,0,0,,Oh, you're totally fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.03,0:12:16.17,Default,OJI,0,0,0,,I just thought, it's rare to see you \Nspacing out like that during work.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.17,0:12:19.92,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Oh... I was just thinking about my exams.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.26,0:12:23.18,Default,OJI,0,0,0,,Whoa, that just reminded me of mine, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.18,0:12:27.01,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,If Senpai heard our conversation \Njust now, it'll be awkward.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.99,0:12:30.92,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,All right, we should get goin' soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.92,0:12:32.31,Default,SHUN,0,0,0,,Yeah, you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.73,0:12:34.65,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Thanks for the meal!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.27,0:12:36.53,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Uh, sorry, I'll be back.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.35,0:12:41.19,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Senpai!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.93,0:12:46.33,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,U-Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.24,0:12:50.55,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Thank you... for dining with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.90,0:12:52.62,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.73,0:12:56.60,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Later.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.84,0:13:02.74,Default,SHUN,0,0,0,,Uh, later, Prince!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.74,0:13:03.80,Default,SENTARO,0,0,0,,Take care!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.07,0:13:08.94,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,Huh? That seemed a little...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.80,0:13:13.73,Default,SENTARO,0,0,0,,That was kinda cold, don't ya think?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.73,0:13:15.03,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,What was?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.03,0:13:18.98,Default,SENTARO,0,0,0,,The way you spoke to \Nthe Prince on your way out.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.98,0:13:21.05,Default,SENTARO,0,0,0,,You were all, like, "Yeah, bye."
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.05,0:13:22.23,Default,SHUN,0,0,0,,Yeah, I can see that.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.23,0:13:24.02,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Nah, it wasn't like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.02,0:13:26.74,Default,SENTARO,0,0,0,,Huh, could it be that our \NIchi is jealous?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.97,0:13:30.49,Default,SENTARO,0,0,0,,Look at you! You actually \N{\i1}do{\i0} have a cute side to ya!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.49,0:13:32.24,Default,SHUN,0,0,0,,Hey, keep it down, Sentaro.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.03,0:13:35.98,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Is that a problem?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.96,0:13:40.54,Default,SENTARO,0,0,0,,N-No... It's not a problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.38,0:13:45.34,sign_generic,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\c&HECF8F8&\bord0\fnArial Black\pos(206.666,27.334)\frx0\fry2\frz9.541}Please select payment method
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.38,0:13:45.34,sign_generic,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fs13\c&HFEFEFE&\bord0\fnArial Black\frx0\fry2\frz11.26\pos(132.653,114.667)}Cash
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.38,0:13:45.34,sign_generic,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fs13\c&HFEFEFE&\bord0\fnArial Black\frx0\fry2\pos(228.665,95.334)\frz11.26}Credit Card
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.38,0:13:45.34,sign_generic,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fs13\c&HFEFEFE&\bord0\fnArial Black\frx0\fry2\frz11.26\pos(317.332,78.001)}QR Payment
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.38,0:13:45.34,sign_generic,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fs13\c&HFEFEFE&\bord0\fnArial Black\frx0\fry2\pos(146.665,176.001)\frz13.71}Point Payment
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.38,0:13:45.34,sign_generic,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fs13\c&HFEFEFE&\bord0\fnArial Black\frx0\fry2\pos(243.332,154.667)\frz12.54}IC Card
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.38,0:13:45.34,sign_generic,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fs10\c&HFEFEFE&\bord0\fnArial Black\frz15.18\frx358\fry12\pos(136.665,254)}Go Back
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.38,0:13:45.34,sign_generic,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fs10\c&HFEFEFE&\bord0\fnArial Black\frx358\fry12\pos(361.331,193.333)\frz14.49}Call Clerk
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.44,0:13:45.34,Default,SENTARO,0,0,0,,Wha?! What was that?\NA chill just ran up my spine!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.56,0:13:48.13,Default,SENTARO,0,0,0,,Actually, I think it's the first \Ntime I've ever seen Ichi angry.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.13,0:13:49.55,Default,SHUN,0,0,0,,Same.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.89,0:13:54.17,Default,SHUN,0,0,0,,It's like, even {\i1}he{\i0} gets jealous \Nand stuff sometimes, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.98,0:14:01.44,sign_generic,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\an7\bord0\p1\fscy220\alpha&H20&\c&HD6D7F7&}m 0 0 l 185 0 185 80 0 80
Dialogue: 1,0:13:57.98,0:14:00.33,sign_generic,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fade(0,158)\fs15\an7\c&HA09FA2&\3c&HFDFDFD&\pos(15,22)}What?\NWhat's wrong?
Dialogue: 1,0:13:57.98,0:14:00.71,sign_generic,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fade(0,580)\fs15\an9\c&HEFECFE&\3c&H9B8BE2&\pos(190,55)}Sorry. I'm getting distracted \Nbecause you're here.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:58.14,0:14:00.36,sign_generic,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fade(155,0)\fs15\an9\c&HEFECFE&\3c&H9B8BE2&\pos(190,87)}It feels like a parent\Nclassroom observation day.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:58.21,0:14:00.36,sign_generic,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fade(85,0)\fs15\an7\c&HA09FA2&\3c&HFDFDFD&\pos(15,122)}Stop making me laugh
Dialogue: 1,0:13:58.25,0:14:00.36,sign_generic,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fade(129,0)\fs15\an7\c&HA09FA2&\3c&HFDFDFD&\pos(15,140)}Hey
Dialogue: 1,0:13:58.42,0:14:00.36,sign_generic,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fade(209,0)\fs15\an7\c&HA09FA2&\3c&HFDFDFD&\pos(15,158)}Today after school, would \Nyou like to go somewhere?
Dialogue: 1,0:14:00.36,0:14:01.44,sign_generic,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fade(500,0)\fs15\an9\c&HEFECFE&\3c&H9B8BE2&\pos(190,22)}It feels like a parent\Nclassroom observation day.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:00.36,0:14:01.44,sign_generic,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fade(500,0)\fs15\an7\c&HA09FA2&\3c&HFDFDFD&\pos(15,56)}Stop making me laugh
Dialogue: 1,0:14:00.36,0:14:01.44,sign_generic,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fade(500,0)\fs15\an7\c&HA09FA2&\3c&HFDFDFD&\pos(15,74)}Hey
Dialogue: 1,0:14:00.36,0:14:01.44,sign_generic,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fade(500,0)\fs15\an7\c&HA09FA2&\3c&HFDFDFD&\pos(15,92)}Today after school, would \Nyou like to go somewhere?
Dialogue: 1,0:14:00.38,0:14:01.44,sign_generic,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fade(500,0)\fs15\an9\c&HEFECFE&\3c&H9B8BE2&\pos(190,124)}I'm sorry.\NI have work today
Dialogue: 1,0:14:00.42,0:14:01.44,sign_generic,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fade(209,0)\fs15\an7\c&HA09FA2&\3c&HFDFDFD&\pos(15,155)}Okay, got it
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.55,0:14:08.86,flashback italics,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,I'm just jealous is all.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.12,0:14:10.90,flashback italics,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Later.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.85,0:14:13.91,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,It was all so sudden.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.54,0:14:16.89,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,How was I supposed to respond to that?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.58,0:14:22.09,Default,BIG SISTER,0,0,0,,I'm home.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.67,0:14:25.55,Default,BIG SISTER,0,0,0,,Whoa! Gosh, it's dark!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.67,0:14:27.73,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Welcome home.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.38,0:14:30.61,Default,BIG SISTER,0,0,0,,At least turn the light on, sheesh!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.61,0:14:31.77,Default,BIG SISTER,0,0,0,,Where's Mom?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.77,0:14:32.60,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Night shift.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.60,0:14:34.10,Default,BIG SISTER,0,0,0,,Oh yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.56,0:14:37.06,Default,BIG SISTER,0,0,0,,So is that new hire your boyfriend, Yoi?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.06,0:14:37.90,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.90,0:14:39.61,Default,BIG SISTER,0,0,0,,Oh, he's not?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.61,0:14:42.02,Default,BIG SISTER,0,0,0,,His name is Oji, so I thought that's \Nwhere "Prince" came from.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.27,0:14:44.15,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Enough with the puns!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.15,0:14:46.86,Default,BIG SISTER,0,0,0,,Aw, bummer. That's boring.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.13,0:14:51.49,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,And, in all actuality, I'm not dating him.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.49,0:14:53.95,Default,BIG SISTER,0,0,0,,Why aren't you guys dating?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.93,0:14:58.71,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,He's kinda the type I can't fully trust.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.55,0:15:03.75,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,He's so carefree and shifty,\Nhe's hard to figure out.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.50,0:15:09.63,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,If I were to compare him to an animal, \Nhe'd be a cunning fox that tricks people.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.87,0:15:12.18,Default,BIG SISTER,0,0,0,,What? He {\i1}is{\i0} a prince, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.18,0:15:16.35,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Besides, neither of us is entirely \Nsure about our feelings yet...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.07,0:15:23.07,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,He tells me he loves me, but it's \Nalways just about the way I look.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.48,0:15:28.54,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,And this is a first for me, too, so \Nit's all a bit overwhelming, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.54,0:15:29.32,Default,BIG SISTER,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.32,0:15:32.02,Default,BIG SISTER,0,0,0,,Who cares if it's just about looks?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.02,0:15:35.08,Default,BIG SISTER,0,0,0,,And what's wrong with being smitten by \Nsomeone who has an interest in you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.40,0:15:37.95,Default,BIG SISTER,0,0,0,,You need to learn to go with \Nthe flow a little more.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.17,0:15:42.67,Default,BIG SISTER,0,0,0,,Tell me, do you get the flutters \Nwith anyone besides this guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.67,0:15:43.58,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.22,0:15:47.84,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,Besides... Senpai?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.68,0:15:51.54,Default,BIG SISTER,0,0,0,,Well, it's good to be cautious \Nbefore you cross a stone bridge.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.54,0:15:54.30,Default,BIG SISTER,0,0,0,,But hitting it too many times \Nmay just break it, so be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.40,0:16:00.77,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,It's never crossed my mind before.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.44,0:16:06.61,Default,STUDENT,0,0,0,,Hey, where did you put the measuring cup?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.61,0:16:07.90,Default,STUDENT,0,0,0,,We're gonna make muffins, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.22,0:16:08.61,Default,NOBARA,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.61,0:16:09.23,Default,KOTOBUKI,0,0,0,,Yoi-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.47,0:16:12.45,Default,KOTOBUKI,0,0,0,,How much flour were you supposed to sift?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.45,0:16:12.86,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,What...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.86,0:16:14.91,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.13,0:16:16.87,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,You're right, sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.52,0:16:19.87,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Ah, I'm sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.87,0:16:21.66,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Oh, gosh, it's burnt!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.64,0:16:29.34,Default,KOTOBUKI,0,0,0,,It's rare to see you make so many \Nsimple mistakes, Yoi-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.19,0:16:32.06,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,I was a little lost in thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.06,0:16:33.54,Default,NOBARA,0,0,0,,Oh, what is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.54,0:16:36.02,Default,NOBARA,0,0,0,,Is it about the festival next week?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.02,0:16:37.93,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,Oh, right. The festival.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.93,0:16:40.27,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,We're still going together... aren't we?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.63,0:16:43.49,Default,KOTOBUKI,0,0,0,,Well, I'm glad one of \Nthem turned out pretty.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.49,0:16:45.74,Default,KOTOBUKI,0,0,0,,Why don't you take that to Senpai?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.29,0:16:47.72,Default,KOTOBUKI,0,0,0,,Might as well!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.72,0:16:48.69,Default,NOBARA,0,0,0,,Go on, go on.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.97,0:16:50.57,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,There's no way I'm taking it to him!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.57,0:16:52.26,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,I said stop teasing me, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.19,0:16:56.87,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.07,0:16:59.17,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,I'll do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.35,0:17:10.00,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.17,0:17:14.02,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Do you know where I \Ncould find Ichimura-senpai?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.02,0:17:16.50,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,It's about the committee.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.50,0:17:19.97,Default,BOY 1,0,0,0,,Oh, he got called to the staff room for\Nthe incident during our lunch break.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.97,0:17:21.81,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,What, the staff room?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.81,0:17:22.94,Default,BOY 2,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.94,0:17:24.77,Default,BOY 1,0,0,0,,Oh, sorry, see ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.82,0:17:27.95,Default,BOY 2,0,0,0,,Hey, was that a first-year?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.95,0:17:29.93,Default,BOY 1,0,0,0,,She was so handsome that I freaked out.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.93,0:17:30.73,Default,BOY 2,0,0,0,,What the?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.73,0:17:32.72,Default,BOY 1,0,0,0,,I swear my inner feminine \Nside was, like, screaming.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.72,0:17:33.47,Default,BOY 2,0,0,0,,Are you serious?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.47,0:17:35.20,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,Forget flutters.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.20,0:17:36.99,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,I didn't feel a single...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.29,0:17:42.23,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,Hang on. What am I even doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.41,0:17:45.78,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,That's just being rude.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.29,0:17:47.25,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Yoi-chan?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.42,0:17:53.64,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.46,0:17:58.05,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Oh, um. I just happened to be passing by, and...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.36,0:17:58.72,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.82,0:18:11.11,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,That was a close one.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.73,0:18:12.54,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Are you hurt?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.02,0:18:14.74,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,No... I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.66,0:18:18.55,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Whoops.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.06,0:18:20.82,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.64,0:18:24.22,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,It's okay... Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.66,0:18:26.68,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,So, what are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.24,0:18:29.01,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,You got business on the second-year floor?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.56,0:18:31.16,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Uh, um...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.16,0:18:34.09,Default,SENTARO,0,0,0,,Ichi!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.31,0:18:37.64,Default,SHUN,0,0,0,,How long's this gonna take?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.64,0:18:39.32,Default,SENTARO,0,0,0,,Ichi!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.32,0:18:40.76,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,I'm comin'!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.57,0:18:42.67,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Well, Imma go.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.67,0:18:44.51,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Oh, um...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.45,0:18:50.95,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Would you like to walk home together?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.09,0:18:56.09,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Give me a sec.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.50,0:18:59.27,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Sorry, guys, you go on ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.27,0:19:00.67,Default,SENTARO,0,0,0,,Huh? You sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.67,0:19:01.95,Default,SHUN,0,0,0,,All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.95,0:19:03.27,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,See ya later!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.86,0:19:06.54,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.22,0:19:16.22,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Let's go home.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.33,0:19:20.52,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,Is there even anyone else...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.69,0:19:24.13,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,who can make me feel this way?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.22,0:19:30.44,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Um, did you need to do \Nsomething in the staff room?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.79,0:19:35.65,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Oh, they found out I slipped out\N during lunch to buy a beef bowl.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.65,0:19:38.36,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,A beef... That'd definitely \Nget you in trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.60,0:19:41.05,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,I really thought I wouldn't get caught.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.37,0:19:43.32,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,I used all sorts of secret shortcuts, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.32,0:19:47.54,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,Come to think of it, he does come \Nout of strange places, doesn't he?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.85,0:19:50.28,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,If only I were a wizard.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.28,0:19:54.54,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,I could use a broom to zoom around, \Nor become invisible to sneak out.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.54,0:19:58.92,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Wouldn't it be faster to use magic \Nto make the beef bowl then?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.92,0:20:00.82,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,You are a wizard, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.80,0:20:02.85,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Tou​ché.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.23,0:20:04.93,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,He didn't think of that?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.93,0:20:08.09,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Genius! Marvelous! Beautiful!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.09,0:20:11.25,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,What does "beautiful" have \Nto do with it?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.17,0:20:15.42,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,Huh... We're sort of having a \Nnormal conversation, aren't we?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.16,0:20:23.03,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Um, this is totally off the subject, \Nbut if you'd like, this is...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.03,0:20:24.02,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,Who is even?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.02,0:20:24.49,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Yes?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.73,0:20:27.06,italics,OJI,0,0,0,,Hello, Yoi-san? It's Oji.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.06,0:20:28.20,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Oji-kun?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.49,0:20:31.25,Default,OJI,0,0,0,,Sorry, I couldn't get \Na hold of the manager.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.63,0:20:35.46,Default,OJI,0,0,0,,Could you let him know that my train's \Ndelayed and I'm running a little late?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.46,0:20:37.13,italics,YOI,0,0,0,,Oh, all right. Will do.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.54,0:20:38.92,Default,OJI,0,0,0,,Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.47,0:20:43.28,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,You guys exchanged numbers, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.28,0:20:46.34,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Well, yeah. We work in shifts, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.85,0:20:48.22,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Uh-huh...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.99,0:20:50.21,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,I don't like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.47,0:20:57.44,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Did you know that Mr. Handsome \Nclearly has a thing for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.44,0:21:00.02,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Huh? No, he doesn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.02,0:21:01.89,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,We're just work buddies.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.61,0:21:04.53,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Guess it's fine, if you don't see it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.53,0:21:09.74,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,W-Well, you have a ton \Nof numbers from girls, Senpai.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.03,0:21:11.40,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Then I'll delete them all right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.40,0:21:13.20,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,N-No, that's not the point!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.54,0:21:15.61,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,You did it yesterday, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.61,0:21:19.17,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Could you please lay off the talk \Nabout how jealous you are?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.20,0:21:25.67,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,You might be used to \Nsaying that stuff to girls,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.20,0:21:28.83,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,but I have a hard time \Nresponding to it...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.16,0:21:30.23,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,I'm not used to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.53,0:21:33.64,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,I'm not used to stuff like this either!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.31,0:21:43.40,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Forget it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.90,0:21:44.92,Default,YOI,0,0,0,,Um, Senpa—
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.92,0:21:45.48,Default,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.05,0:21:46.87,top,KOHAKU,0,0,0,,Going home.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.66,0:21:56.96,flashback italics,BIG SISTER,0,0,0,,Well, it's good to be cautious \Nbefore you cross a stone bridge.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.72,0:21:59.88,flashback italics,BIG SISTER,0,0,0,,But hitting it too many \Ntimes may just break it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.51,0:22:15.33,sign_generic,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\blur0.25\fade(529,455)\fs18\c&H39211F&\bord0\b1\fnComic Sans MS\t(4365,4820,\c&HFFFFFF&)\pos(344.001,215.332)\frz16.87}I'm Just Jealous Is All
